parliament will set out its position on  a raft of ambitious climate clause the  fit for 55 package is designed to cut  greenhouse gas emissions and achieve  climate neutrality by 2050. the  proposals include better use of land  emissions trading schemes and help for  those affected by energy poverty  meps will discuss russia's war in  ukraine with the speaker of the  ukrainian parliament as well as the  latest round of eu sanctions the  european parliament is expected to  demand more support for kiev stronger eu  defence capabilities and ways to reduce  energy dependence  parliament is set to propose changes to  the eu's law making process giving it  the right to initiate legislation meps  have long argued that the move would  strengthen democracy and restore balance  between the eu institutions  the winner of the lux audience award  will be announced in the presence of  representatives of the three shortlisted  films  flee great freedom and quovardus ida  european cinema lovers and meps have  been casting votes for their favourites  with each group weighing 50 percent  meps will vote on giving more powers to  europol the eu's law enforcement agency  to help police and judicial cooperation  in criminal investigations it would  facilitate cooperation between national  authorities especially customs and at  borders  [Music]
 

